          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "1) By Air "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Marsa Alam International Airport, situated 67 kilometers north of the city along the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "Al-Quseir"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " road, is your aerial gateway to this serene destination. Given the absence of public transport from the airport, arranging a transfer with your hotel in advance is essential for a smooth arrival."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Qoseir",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "EgyptAir, the national carrier, operates "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "flights to Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " five times a week. Be aware that flight prices can vary significantly with the season and ticket availability. Additionally, the airport caters to various charter flights, predominantly from the UK and Europe, broadening your "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "options for reaching this picturesque Red Sea"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " town."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/full-day-trip-to-cairo-by-plane-from-luxor/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/full-day-trip-to-cairo-by-plane-from-luxor",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/the-pearl-of-red-sea-hurghada/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/the-pearl-of-red-sea-hurghada",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "2) By Bus "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "81fgq2pivuem",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Marsa Alam bus station, located just beyond the T-junction on the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "9ozc3jabknbm",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "t33l6mt6wihv"
              ],
              "text": "Edfu"
            },
            {
              "_key": "rx2hfhfzph4c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " road, offers a more grounded approach to traveling. Buses to "
            },
            {
              "_key": "7lp3hv8ohsmf",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "a4mcvaofrapa"
              ],
              "text": "Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "xhb2wklqwe21",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", priced between E£140 to E£280 for a journey of 10 to 11 hours, run via Al-Quseir (E£50 to E£80, two hours) and "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000014"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " (E£60 to E£120, four hours). Departures are scheduled for 1.30pm and 8.30pm, but it’s advisable to check the latest timetables as they tend to change frequently."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/group-tour-luxor-hurghada/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/luxor-highlights-group-day-tour-from-hurghada",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "t33l6mt6wihv",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58841",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "a4mcvaofrapa",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Additionally, there are a few "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000019"
              ],
              "text": "services each day"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " heading to Shalatein, with a travel time of about four hours and costing between E£50 to E£75."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/the-egypt-panorama-tour-8-days/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/8-days-egypt-panorama-tour",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "3) Servees “Min-Van” "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For a more local mode of transport, the servees (minivan) station adjacent to the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000020"
              ],
              "text": "bus"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " station offers regular services to Al-Quseir. The journey, lasting approximately two hours, costs about E£60. The servees provide an authentic and often lively travel experience, popular among both locals and adventurous tourists."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/cairo-travel-guide/guide-to-arrival/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/cairo/how-to-go-to-cairo",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "These various modes of transportation to Marsa Alam offer a range of experiences, whether you prefer the speed and convenience of air travel, the scenic "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000025"
              ],
              "text": "route by bus"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", or the bustling local life of a minivan journey. Each option "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000028"
              ],
              "text": "provides its own unique"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " window into the beauty and culture of Egypt as you journey towards the tranquil shores of Marsa Alam."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/saint-catherine-travel-guide/pilgrims-travel-guide/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/saint-catherine/how-to-go-to-saint-catherine",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/nour-el-nil-assouan-dahabiya/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/nile-cruises/nour-el-nil-assouan-dahabiya",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002c",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/ella-brk-aC2vAOyIOgc-unsplash-1.jpg",
