    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "vou67posjj4h",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cómo ir a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "ovdfg4sznvp7",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "kdzneru904sl"
              ],
              "text": "Marsa Alam"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "kdzneru904sl",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58885",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "1) Por aire "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El Aeropuerto Internacional de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "Marsa Alam"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", situado a 67 kilómetros al norte de la ciudad por la carretera de Al-Quseir, es tu puerta de entrada aérea a este sereno destino."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dada la ausencia de transporte público desde el aeropuerto, organizar con antelación un traslado con tu hotel es esencial para llegar sin problemas."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/excursiones-de-un-dia-en-grupo-reducido-a-marsa-alam/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/marsa-alam/excursiones-de-un-dia-en-grupo-reducido-a-marsa-alam",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "EgyptAir, la compañía aérea nacional, opera vuelos a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000c"
              ],
              "text": "El Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " cinco veces por semana."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ten en cuenta que los precios de los vuelos pueden variar significativamente según la temporada y la disponibilidad de billetes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Además, el aeropuerto recibe varios vuelos chárter, principalmente desde el Reino Unido y Europa, lo que amplía tus opciones para llegar a esta pintoresca ciudad del Mar Rojo."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-el-cairo-para-aficionados-a-la-historia/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/guia-de-el-cairo-para-aficionados-a-la-historia",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "2) En autobús "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La estación de autobuses de Marsa Alam, situada un poco más allá del cruce en T de la carretera de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000017"
              ],
              "text": "Edfu"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", ofrece una forma más sencilla de viajar."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "6w5non2v78pi",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Los autobuses a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "j2c9ypv7au2p",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "lbfhakyyejb6"
              ],
              "text": "El Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "fqvoo6bt7iuk",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", cuyo precio oscila entre 140 y 280 "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001c"
              ],
              "text": "libras egipcias"
            },
            {
              "_key": "opkjzacnx061",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " por un viaje de 10 a 11 horas, pasan por Al-Quseir (50 a 80 libras egipcias, dos horas) y "
            },
            {
              "_key": "vd65843wpne7",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "au20o58aundt"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "r4195fl1wd7i",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " (60 a 120 libras egipcias, cuatro horas)."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000020"
              ],
              "text": "Las salidas están programadas para"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " las 13.30 y las 20.30 horas, pero es aconsejable comprobar los horarios más recientes, ya que suelen cambiar con frecuencia."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-edfu/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/edfu",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/moneda-en-egipto/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/travel-tips/la-moneda-en-egipto-la-libra-egipcia-el-efectivo-y-las-tarjetas",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/consejos-para-las-familias/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/travel-tips/viajar-a-egipto-con-ninos-el-dia-a-dia-practico",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "lbfhakyyejb6",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "au20o58aundt",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Además, hay unos cuantos servicios diarios que se dirigen a Shalatein, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000025"
              ],
              "text": "con una duración del"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " viaje de unas cuatro horas y un coste de entre 50 y 75 libras."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/egipto-con-una-feluca-tradicional/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/velas-en-el-nilo-viaje-privado-de-diez-dias-en-faluca-de-asuan-a-luxor",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "3) Sirve \"Min-Van\" "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000033",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Para un medio de transporte más local, la estación de servees (minivans) adyacente a la estación de autobuses ofrece servicios regulares a Al-Quseir."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El viaje, de unas dos horas de duración, cuesta unos 60¤."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Los servees proporcionan una experiencia de viaje auténtica y a menudo animada, popular tanto entre los "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000030"
              ],
              "text": "lugareños como entre los turistas"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " aventureros."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/historicos-de-egipto/"
              },
