            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Estos diversos modos de transporte a Marsa Alam ofrecen una amplia gama de experiencias, tanto si prefieres la rapidez y comodidad del viaje en avión, la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000036",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ruta panorámica en autobús"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000037",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " o la bulliciosa vida local de un viaje en minivan."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000038",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000039",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cada opción ofrece su propia ventana única a la belleza y la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000003a"
              ],
              "text": "cultura de Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " mientras viajas hacia las tranquilas costas de Marsa Alam."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003a",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/etiqueta-cultural-en-egipto/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/travel-tips/etiqueta-cultural-en-egipto-como-desenvolverse-en-la-vida-diaria",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Creado el 18 de marzo de 2020"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000041",
